#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:2
msgid "Freezing scripts into the firmware"
msgstr "Zamrzavanje skripti u ugrađeni program (firmware)"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:4
msgid ""
"A *frozen* module is a ``.py`` file compiled to bytecode and linked into the"
" firmware image at build time. The runtime imports a frozen module straight "
"from flash, without ever looking at the on-disk filesystem. For a shipped "
"product this is the right place for the application code: nothing for the "
"end user to delete, nothing for a stale ``.py`` on the SD card to override, "
"and the cam runs the same code every boot regardless of what (if anything) "
"is on its drives."
msgstr ""
"*Zamrznuti* modul je ``.py`` datoteka prevedena u bajtkod i povezana u sliku"
" ugrađenog programa (firmware) u trenutku izgradnje. Tijekom izvođenja modul"
" se uvozi izravno iz flash memorije, bez ikakvog pristupa datotečnom sustavu"
" na disku. Za gotov proizvod ovo je pravo mjesto za aplikacijski kod: ništa "
"što bi krajnji korisnik mogao izbrisati, ništa što bi zastarjela ``.py`` "
"datoteka na SD kartici mogla nadjačati, a kamera pri svakom pokretanju "
"izvodi isti kod bez obzira na to što (ako išta) se nalazi na njezinim "
"pogonima."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:13
msgid ""
"This page covers the startup sequence the cam follows, then how "
"``manifest.py`` and the ``freeze`` directive bake an application into the "
"build."
msgstr ""
"Ova stranica obrađuje slijed pokretanja kojeg kamera prati, a zatim kako "
"``manifest.py`` i direktiva ``freeze`` ugrađuju aplikaciju u izgradnju."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:18
msgid "The startup sequence"
msgstr "Slijed pokretanja"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:20
msgid "What runs, and when, on a cam coming out of reset:"
msgstr "Što se izvodi i kada, na kameri koja izlazi iz ponovnog postavljanja:"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:22
msgid ""
"**The bootloader.** Power-up enters a short DFU window the IDE uses to push "
"firmware updates. The window closes after a few seconds and the bootloader "
"hands off to MicroPython. A running script can re-enter this window on "
"demand by calling :func:`machine.bootloader`."
msgstr ""
"**Pokretač (bootloader).** Uključivanje napajanja ulazi u kratak DFU prozor "
"koji IDE koristi za slanje ažuriranja ugrađenog programa (firmware). Prozor "
"se zatvara nakon nekoliko sekundi i pokretač (bootloader) predaje "
"upravljanje MicroPythonu. Skripta koja se izvodi može po potrebi ponovno ući"
" u taj prozor pozivom :func:`machine.bootloader`\\ ."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Frozen filesystem init.** Before any application code runs, the runtime "
"brings the filesystems up. Internal flash is mounted at ``/flash`` (and "
"formatted blank if there is nothing there). If an SD card is present *and* a"
" marker file called ``SKIPSD`` does **not** exist on internal flash, the SD "
"card is mounted at ``/sdcard``. ROMFS, when the build includes it, is "
"mounted automatically at ``/rom``. The working directory is set to the boot "
"directory (``/sdcard`` if the card mounted, ``/flash`` otherwise), and "
":data:`sys.path` is populated with ``/flash``, ``/flash/lib``, ``/sdcard``, "
"``/sdcard/lib``, ``/rom``, and ``/rom/lib``. The flash-resident setup is "
"handled by a frozen module called ``_boot.py`` -- port and board "
"infrastructure, not an application hook. Applications do not customise "
"``_boot.py``; the build does. Dropping a ``SKIPSD`` file onto flash from the"
" IDE is the supported way to make the cam boot from internal flash instead "
"of the SD card."
msgstr ""
"**Inicijalizacija zamrznutog datotečnog sustava.** Prije nego što se izvede "
"ikakav aplikacijski kod, izvođenje pokreće datotečne sustave. Interna flash "
"memorija montira se na ``/flash`` (i formatira se prazno ako ondje ničega "
"nema). Ako je SD kartica prisutna *i* ako datoteka markera nazvana "
"``SKIPSD`` **ne** postoji na internoj flash memoriji, SD kartica montira se "
"na ``/sdcard``\\ . ROMFS, kada ga izgradnja uključuje, automatski se montira"
" na ``/rom``\\ . Radni direktorij postavlja se na direktorij pokretanja (\\ "
"``/sdcard`` ako je kartica montirana, inače ``/flash``\\ ), a "
":data:`sys.path` popunjava se s ``/flash``\\ , ``/flash/lib``\\ , "
"``/sdcard``\\ , ``/sdcard/lib``\\ , ``/rom`` i ``/rom/lib``\\ . Postavljanje"
" koje se nalazi u flash memoriji obrađuje zamrznuti modul nazvan "
"``_boot.py`` -- infrastruktura porta i ploče, a ne aplikacijska kuka. "
"Aplikacije ne prilagođavaju ``_boot.py``\\ ; to čini izgradnja. Postavljanje"
" datoteke ``SKIPSD`` na flash memoriju iz IDE-a podržan je način da se "
"kamera natjera na pokretanje iz interne flash memorije umjesto iz SD "
"kartice."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:46
msgid ""
"**Pre-REPL setup.** ``boot.py`` runs on *every* soft reset -- cold boot, "
"``Ctrl-D`` from the REPL, the running script returning, and watchdog "
"recovery -- *before* the REPL becomes reachable. Its job is to prepare the "
"environment the rest of the system runs in: the kind of setup the REPL, the "
"application, and any recovery tooling all need in place to function. It is "
"not where the application itself lives. ``main.py`` is the application's "
"entry point."
msgstr ""
"**Postavljanje prije REPL-a.** ``boot.py`` izvodi se pri *svakom* mekanom "
"ponovnom postavljanju -- hladnom pokretanju, ``Ctrl-D`` iz REPL-a, vraćanju "
"skripte koja se izvodi te oporavku nadzornog mehanizma -- *prije* nego što "
"REPL postane dostupan. Njegov je posao pripremiti okruženje u kojem se "
"izvodi ostatak sustava: vrstu postavljanja koju REPL, aplikacija i svi alati"
" za oporavak trebaju imati spremnu da bi funkcionirali. To nije mjesto gdje "
"živi sama aplikacija. ``main.py`` je ulazna točka aplikacije."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:55
msgid ""
"**Main loop.** ``main.py`` is the application's main loop. Runs once on cold"
" boot, immediately after ``boot.py``. *Not* re-run on subsequent soft resets"
" -- the cam drops to the REPL instead. That asymmetry matters for "
"development (a Ctrl-D drops to the REPL without re-running the loop, so the "
"developer can inspect state) but not for production: a fielded cam sees "
"power-on, watchdog, and hard resets, which are all hardware resets that re-"
"enter the cold-boot path and run ``main.py`` again."
msgstr ""
"**Glavna petlja.** ``main.py`` je glavna petlja aplikacije. Izvodi se jednom"
" pri hladnom pokretanju, neposredno nakon ``boot.py``\\ . *Ne* izvodi se "
"ponovno pri sljedećim mekanim ponovnim postavljanjima -- kamera umjesto toga"
" prelazi na REPL. Ta asimetrija je važna za razvoj (Ctrl-D prelazi na REPL "
"bez ponovnog izvođenja petlje, pa razvojni programer može pregledati "
"stanje), ali ne i za proizvodnju: kamera u upotrebi doživljava uključivanje "
"napajanja, nadzorni mehanizam i tvrda ponovna postavljanja, što su sve "
"hardverska ponovna postavljanja koja ponovno ulaze u put hladnog pokretanja "
"i ponovno izvode ``main.py``\\ ."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:66
msgid "Freezing into the firmware"
msgstr "Zamrzavanje u ugrađeni program (firmware)"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:68
msgid ""
"A board's frozen-module set is declared in ``boards/<TARGET>/manifest.py`` "
"in the firmware tree. The manifest is a small Python file that calls a "
"handful of directives:"
msgstr ""
"Skup zamrznutih modula ploče deklarira se u ``boards/<TARGET>/manifest.py`` "
"u stablu ugrađenog programa (firmware). Manifest je mala Python datoteka "
"koja poziva nekolicinu direktiva:"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:73
msgid ""
"``freeze(\"$(OMV_LIB_DIR)/\", \"foo.py\")`` -- bakes a single ``foo.py`` "
"into the build."
msgstr ""
"``freeze(\"$(OMV_LIB_DIR)/\", \"foo.py\")`` -- ugrađuje jednu ``foo.py`` u "
"izgradnju."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:75
msgid ""
"``package(\"mylib\", base_path=\"...\")`` -- bakes a multi-file Python "
"package, preserving its directory layout under the given base path."
msgstr ""
"``package(\"mylib\", base_path=\"...\")`` -- ugrađuje Python paket s više "
"datoteka, čuvajući njegov raspored direktorija ispod zadanog osnovnog puta."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:78
msgid ""
"``include(\"...\")`` -- pulls in another manifest file. The board manifests "
"use this to share common module sets."
msgstr ""
"``include(\"...\")`` -- uvlači drugu datoteku manifesta. Manifesti ploča ovo"
" koriste za dijeljenje zajedničkih skupova modula."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:80
msgid ""
"``require(\"logging\")`` -- pulls in a named upstream ``micropython-lib`` "
"module by name."
msgstr ""
"``require(\"logging\")`` -- uvlači imenovani uzvodni ``micropython-lib`` "
"modul po imenu."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:83
msgid ""
"A minimal application manifest adds one ``freeze`` line per top-level script"
" and a ``package`` line per package the application depends on."
msgstr ""
"Minimalni aplikacijski manifest dodaje jedan ``freeze`` redak po skripti "
"najviše razine i jedan ``package`` redak po paketu o kojem aplikacija ovisi."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:88
msgid "Where the source lives"
msgstr "Gdje se nalazi izvorni kod"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:90
msgid ""
"Application source lives under ``scripts/libraries/`` in the firmware tree, "
"alongside the modules the build already freezes. The manifest variable "
"``$(OMV_LIB_DIR)`` expands to that path, so manifest entries stay short. "
"Editing the manifest is already an in-tree operation, so keeping the source "
"in-tree avoids juggling a separate project repo on the path resolution."
msgstr ""
"Izvorni kod aplikacije nalazi se pod ``scripts/libraries/`` u stablu "
"ugrađenog programa (firmware), uz module koje izgradnja već zamrzava. "
"Varijabla manifesta ``$(OMV_LIB_DIR)`` proširuje se u taj put, pa unosi "
"manifesta ostaju kratki. Uređivanje manifesta već je operacija unutar "
"stabla, pa čuvanje izvornog koda unutar stabla izbjegava žongliranje "
"zasebnim projektnim repozitorijem na putu razrješavanja."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:98
msgid ""
"A typical layout for an application that ships a single ``main.py`` plus a "
"supporting package::"
msgstr ""
"Tipičan raspored za aplikaciju koja isporučuje jedan ``main.py`` plus "
"prateći paket::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:107
msgid ""
"And in the board's ``boards/<TARGET>/manifest.py``, one ``freeze`` line for "
"the script and one ``package`` line for the package::"
msgstr ""
"A u ploči ``boards/<TARGET>/manifest.py``\\ , jedan ``freeze`` redak za "
"skriptu i jedan ``package`` redak za paket::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:114
msgid ""
"Single-file scripts -- ``main.py`` here, but the same rule applies to "
"``boot.py`` or any standalone helper -- use ``freeze``. Multi-file packages "
"use ``package``. Adding another script is one more ``freeze`` line; adding "
"another package is one more ``package`` line."
msgstr ""
"Skripte s jednom datotekom -- ovdje ``main.py``\\ , ali isto pravilo vrijedi"
" za ``boot.py`` ili bilo koji samostalni pomoćnik -- koriste ``freeze``\\ . "
"Paketi s više datoteka koriste ``package``\\ . Dodavanje još jedne skripte "
"je još jedan ``freeze`` redak; dodavanje još jednog paketa je još jedan "
"``package`` redak."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:121
msgid "Building and flashing"
msgstr "Izgradnja i prijenos na flash"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:123
msgid ""
"Once the manifest is in place, build the firmware exactly as the "
":doc:`firmware chapter </openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/building>` "
"describes::"
msgstr ""
"Kada je manifest na mjestu, izgradite ugrađeni program (firmware) točno "
"onako kako opisuje :doc:`poglavlje o ugrađenom programu "
"</openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/building>`\\ ::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:130
msgid "The output lands in ``build/<TARGET>/bin/``::"
msgstr "Izlaz se pojavljuje u ``build/<TARGET>/bin/``\\ ::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:136
msgid ""
"Flashing the ``.bin`` and ``.img`` through the IDE lands a cam whose "
"application is part of the build."
msgstr ""
"Prijenos ``.bin`` i ``.img`` putem IDE-a daje kameru čija je aplikacija dio "
"izgradnje."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:139
msgid ""
"The startup sequence above is what makes the bake-in effective: the runtime "
"resolves ``boot.py`` and ``main.py`` to the frozen copies before it ever "
"checks the filesystem, so a shipped cam runs the build's code even if the SD"
" card holds a stale ``boot.py`` left from development."
msgstr ""
"Gore opisani slijed pokretanja čini ugradnju učinkovitom: tijekom izvođenja "
"``boot.py`` i ``main.py`` razrješavaju se u zamrznute kopije prije nego što "
"se ikad provjeri datotečni sustav, pa isporučena kamera izvodi kod iz "
"izgradnje čak i ako SD kartica drži zastarjeli ``boot.py`` ostavljen iz "
"razvoja."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:146
msgid "Lookup order"
msgstr "Redoslijed pretraživanja"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:148
msgid ""
"The override semantics are *different* for the ``boot.py`` / ``main.py`` "
"execution path and for ordinary ``import`` statements. Knowing which is "
"which matters for both production and development:"
msgstr ""
"Semantika nadjačavanja *različita* je za izvršni put ``boot.py`` / "
"``main.py`` i za obične ``import`` naredbe. Poznavanje koje je koje važno je"
" i za proizvodnju i za razvoj:"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:153
msgid ""
"For ``boot.py`` and ``main.py``: the runtime looks for a *frozen* copy "
"first, then the filesystem. A frozen ``boot.py`` cannot be overridden by "
"dropping one onto the SD card -- whoever holds the cam cannot change the "
"entry point without reflashing."
msgstr ""
"Za ``boot.py`` i ``main.py``\\ : tijekom izvođenja prvo se traži *zamrznuta*"
" kopija, a zatim datotečni sustav. Zamrznuti ``boot.py`` ne može se "
"nadjačati postavljanjem na SD karticu -- tko god drži kameru ne može "
"promijeniti ulaznu točku bez ponovnog prijenosa na flash."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:159
msgid ""
"For ``import foo``: the runtime searches :data:`sys.path` first -- which "
"covers ``/flash``, ``/sdcard``, ``/rom``, and their ``lib`` subdirectories "
"-- then frozen modules. A same-name ``foo.py`` on flash or SD *does* "
"override a frozen ``foo``. This is the development affordance: drop a fixed "
"module on the card, soft-reset, see the change without reflashing."
msgstr ""
"Za ``import foo``\\ : tijekom izvođenja prvo se pretražuje :data:`sys.path` "
"-- koji pokriva ``/flash``\\ , ``/sdcard``\\ , ``/rom`` i njihove ``lib`` "
"poddirektorije -- a zatim zamrznuti moduli. ``foo.py`` istog imena na flash "
"memoriji ili SD kartici *doista* nadjačava zamrznuti ``foo``\\ . Ovo je "
"razvojna pogodnost: postavite ispravljen modul na karticu, mekano ponovno "
"postavite i vidite promjenu bez ponovnog prijenosa na flash."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:167
msgid ""
"A shipped product that wants to suppress the filesystem-overrides-frozen "
"behaviour for imports can clear :data:`sys.path` early in ``boot.py``::"
msgstr ""
"Isporučeni proizvod koji želi potisnuti ponašanje gdje datotečni sustav "
"nadjačava zamrznute module za uvoze može rano u ``boot.py`` isprazniti "
":data:`sys.path`\\ ::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:175
msgid ""
"With ``sys.path`` empty, all imports resolve from the frozen modules only; "
"nothing on flash, SD, or ROMFS can shadow them."
msgstr ""
"S praznim ``sys.path`` svi se uvozi razrješavaju samo iz zamrznutih modula; "
"ništa na flash memoriji, SD kartici ili ROMFS-u ne može ih zasjeniti."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:180
msgid "The asset problem"
msgstr "Problem s resursima"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/shipping/freezing-scripts.rst:182
msgid ""
"Freezing is great for code. It is *not* great for large binary assets: "
"machine-learning model files, label tables, JSON configuration, image "
"templates. Embedding those as Python literals balloons the source, "
"recompiles slowly, and wastes the bytecode container on data the interpreter"
" is just going to read raw anyway. The :doc:`romfs-image` page covers the "
"read-only flash filesystem that fills this gap."
msgstr ""
"Zamrzavanje je odlično za kod. *Nije* odlično za velike binarne resurse: "
"datoteke modela strojnog učenja, tablice oznaka, JSON konfiguraciju, "
"predloške slika. Ugrađivanje tih resursa kao Python literala napuhuje "
"izvorni kod, sporo se ponovno prevodi i rasipa spremnik bajtkoda na podatke "
"koje će interpreter ionako samo pročitati sirove. Stranica :doc:`romfs-"
"image` obrađuje datotečni sustav samo za čitanje u flash memoriji koji "
"popunjava tu prazninu."
